        "title": "[2607.25135] ScalableRAG: High-Quality RAG at Zero Ingestion Cost",
        "description": "Abstract page for arXiv paper 2607.25135: ScalableRAG: High-Quality RAG at Zero Ingestion Cost",
        "keywords": null,
        "author": null,
